msgid "多路视频同页，怎样核对是否同一时刻？"
msgstr "Di clips show di same moment"

msgid "暂停后依次单击两路画面，查看状态栏各自的视频路径和时间。软件按采样帧的位置并排：当 **Skip frames** 为 `0` 时，从头计数的第 31 帧，在 30 FPS 视频中约为 1 秒，在 60 FPS 视频中约为 0.5 秒。即使帧率相同，两段视频的拍摄起点也可能不同。要比较同一事件，先用一个两路都能认出的动作核对起点；需要整段同步时，先把素材对齐到相同起点和帧率。"
msgstr "Di Pause, click each clip for turn and check dia path and time for di status bar. Di viewer align sample frame position: wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit wit **As frames dey skip frame frame** Di awa wey dey apun `0`Di frame 31 dey about one second into 30 FPS clip but half a second into 60 FPS clip but half a second into 60 FPS clip. Even clips wit identical frame rate go start for different moments. Di recognizable action for both clips first For synchronized comparison throughout, prepare clips wit match start times and frame rate."

