msgid "**估算一页的像素开销。** 单击一个来源，将鼠标移到状态栏第一栏，可分别查看原图和最终拼接图的分辨率与像素内存估算。磁盘上很小的 JPG 解码后也可能很大：一张 4608 × 2592 的 RGB 图，仅像素就约占 34 MiB。若只关心纹理，可用下例只显示局部，减少最终画布面积；解码、算法和界面副本仍会占用额外内存。"
msgstr "**Di pixel cost of a page** Di source and hover over di first status field to see di dimensions and estimated pixel memory of di original and di final stitch. Di small JPEG on disk don decode to large image: di RGB pixels of 4608 × 2592 image alone take about 34 MiB. If you only need texture detail, di example below reduce di final canvas area by show crops Dicoding, processing and GUI copies still need additional memory."

msgid "用十张超 4K 图像比较同一处原尺寸细节"
