msgstr "Di recording use bird photograph as its reference Di first cell dey di reference; di oda nine show 2×, 3× and 4× downsampling follow by nearest-neighbour, bicubic or Lanczos upsampling. All ten inputs dey input for all ten inputs dey input **4608 × 2592**. Di interpolation baselines demonstrate di workflow. For model comparison, substitute model output for di same input and check say image dimension and coordinates align."

